Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Flash Next CUDA: one-line comments, runFact in its own
 file, cuda_batch.zig back to 600 lines

The lean gate's new findings on this branch: multi-line comments folded to one line within 120 columns,
experts.zig's runFact moved unchanged to experts_fact.zig (re-exported as Nvfp4Experts.runFact), and
factRows' cache as a file-level optional. nvfp4_experts.cu changes in comments only (sm_121a SASS
identical); lean_new.py: 0 new.

(cherry picked from commit 1e1f013636a55ea2a6c6d7f3cc5f4a26c0c4d6f0)
